Package: chinautils
Title: Helper Functions To Deal With Chinese (Administrative) Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Felix", "Turbanisch", , "felix.turbanisch@uni-goettingen.de", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2279-1686"))
Description: A collection of helper functions to make working with Chinese
    (administrative) data easier. It reads and harmonizes trade data exported
    from China Customs (handling encoding, mixed English/Chinese columns and
    arbitrary column order) and harmonizes Chinese country and province names
    across simplified and traditional character variants.
